"lines": [
{
"text": "Water's gone, ground dry, ark on the mountain",
"start": 12.55,
"end": 15.401
},
{
"text": "Three sons standing, now we start countin'",
"start": 15.861,
"end": 18.641
},
{
"text": "Shem, Ham, Japheth (yeah)",
"start": 18.701,
"end": 20.601
},
{
"text": "Sons born after the flood (after the flood)",
"start": 21.121,
"end": 24.361
},
{
"text": "Generations, Genesis Ten, let it drop",
"start": 24.421,
"end": 26.782
},
{
"text": "After the flood (after the flood)",
"start": 26.802,
"end": 28.402
},
{
"text": "Nations rose up from the sons of Noah's blood",
"start": 30.502,
"end": 33.282
},
{
"text": "By their clans, by their tongues, by their lands",
"start": 33.382,
"end": 35.842
},
{
"text": "Every nation on the map came from three men",
"start": 36.682,
"end": 39.622
},
{
"text": "Divided in the earth, let the whole world know",
"start": 40.042,
"end": 44.483
},
{
"text": "Genesis Ten, watch the nations grow",
"start": 46.683,
"end": 51.023
},
{
"text": "Japheth up first, seven sons on the roll",
"start": 51.983,
"end": 55.903
},
{
"text": "Gomer, Magog, Madai, let it go",
"start": 56.443,
"end": 59.083
},
{
"text": "Javan, Tubal, Meshech, Tiras, full set",
"start": 59.483,
"end": 62.344
},
{
"text": "Seven deep from Japheth, ain't a name you forget",
"start": 62.524,
"end": 65.604
},
{
"text": "Gomer had three: Ashkenaz, Riphath",
"start": 65.784,
"end": 68.944
},
{
"text": "Togarmah on the end, put the bass on that",
"start": 69.024,
"end": 72.184
},
{
"text": "Javan had four, coastline flow",
"start": 72.624,
"end": 75.364
},
{
"text": "Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, Dodanim, go",
"start": 75.784,
"end": 78.525
},
{
"text": "From these the coastland peoples spread through their lands",
"start": 78.945,
"end": 82.005
},
{
"text": "Each with his own tongue, his clan, his nation, understand",
"start": 82.105,
"end": 85.125
},
{
"text": "After the flood (after the flood)",
"start": 85.145,
"end": 86.765
},
{
"text": "Nations rose up from the sons of Noah's blood",
"start": 88.885,
"end": 91.645
},
{
"text": "By their clans, by their tongues, by their lands",
"start": 91.745,
"end": 94.245
},
{
"text": "Every nation on the map came from three men",
"start": 95.046,
"end": 97.986
},
{
"text": "Divided in the earth, let the whole world know",
"start": 98.406,
"end": 102.826
},
{
"text": "Genesis Ten, watch the nations grow",
"start": 105.046,
"end": 109.406
},
{
"text": "Sons of Ham: Cush, Mizraim, Put, Canaan",
"start": 111.526,
"end": 114.367
},
{
"text": "Four-man lineup, now the bassline's rainin'",
"start": 114.807,
"end": 117.607
},
{
"text": "Cush had Seba, Havilah, Sabtah",
"start": 118.007,
"end": 120.647
},
{
"text": "Raamah, Sabteca, five sons, stack 'em up",
"start": 120.907,
"end": 123.927
},
{
"text": "Raamah had two: Sheba and Dedan",
"start": 124.527,
"end": 127.287
},
{
"text": "Then Cush fathered Nimrod, the earth heard him comin'",
"start": 127.387,
"end": 130.528
},
{
"text": "First mighty man on the earth, built strong",
"start": 130.988,
"end": 133.768
},
{
"text": "Mighty hunter before the LORD, that's the saying passed on:",
"start": 133.848,
"end": 136.888
},
{
"text": "\"Like Nimrod, a mighty hunter before the LORD\"",
"start": 137.268,
"end": 140.468
},
{
"text": "His kingdom began where the empires were born",
"start": 140.568,
"end": 143.848
},
{
"text": "Babel, Erech, Accad, Calneh",
"start": 143.948,
"end": 145.948
},
{
"text": "Land of Shinar, that's where he laid it",
"start": 146.388,
"end": 148.349
},
{
"text": "From that land to Assyria he went",
"start": 148.409,
"end": 152.249
},
{
"text": "Built Nineveh, Rehoboth-Ir, Calah, cement",
"start": 152.669,
"end": 155.709
},
{
"text": "Then Resen, between Nineveh and Calah set",
"start": 155.909,
"end": 158.789
},
{
"text": "That's the great city, put it on the record",
"start": 159.749,
"end": 162.949
},
{
"text": "Mizraim fathered Ludim, Anamim",
"start": 163.79,
"end": 165.83
},
{
"text": "Lehabim, Naphtuhim, keep it spinnin'",
"start": 166.23,
"end": 168.81
},
{
"text": "Pathrusim, Casluhim, the Philistines came from them",
"start": 169.05,
"end": 172.09
},
{
"text": "Caphtorim to close it, that's the end of the line for him",
"start": 172.49,
"end": 175.75
},
{
"text": "Canaan's firstborn: Sidon, then Heth",
"start": 176.33,
"end": 178.81
},
{
"text": "Jebusites, Amorites, Girgashites, next",
"start": 179.17,
"end": 182.091
},
{
"text": "Hivites, Arkites, Sinites, roll",
"start": 182.631,
"end": 184.871
},
{
"text": "Arvadites, Zemarites, Hamathites, whole",
"start": 185.351,
"end": 188.051
},
{
"text": "Then the clans of Canaan spread abroad",
"start": 188.911,
"end": 191.591
},
{
"text": "Border ran from Sidon, down toward Gerar",
"start": 191.711,
"end": 194.451
},
{
"text": "All the way to Gaza, then toward Sodom",
"start": 195.071,
"end": 197.711
},
{
"text": "Gomorrah, Admah, Zeboiim, as far as Lasha, got 'em",
"start": 197.991,
"end": 200.952
},
{
"text": "These are the sons of Ham, laid out plain",
"start": 201.632,
"end": 206.392
},
{
"text": "By their clans, their tongues, their lands, their nations' names",
"start": 208.312,
"end": 214.292
},
{
"text": "After the flood (after the flood)",
"start": 214.512,
"end": 216.353
},
{
"text": "Nations rose up from the sons of Noah's blood",
"start": 218.453,
"end": 221.193
},
{
"text": "By their clans, by their tongues, by their lands",
"start": 221.293,
"end": 223.753
},
{
"text": "Every nation on the map came from three men",
"start": 224.613,
"end": 227.553
},
{
"text": "Divided in the earth, let the whole world know",
"start": 227.953,
"end": 233.554
},
{
"text": "Genesis Ten, watch the nations grow",
"start": 234.574,
"end": 238.934
},
{
"text": "Now Shem, father of all of Eber's kids",
"start": 239.874,
"end": 243.914
},
{
"text": "Japheth's brother, sons were born to him",
"start": 244.294,
"end": 246.874
},
{
"text": "Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad",
"start": 247.434,
"end": 250.035
},
{
"text": "Lud and Aram, five sons, hold that",
"start": 250.375,
"end": 253.615
},
{
"text": "Aram had Uz, Hul, Gether, Mash",
"start": 253.735,
"end": 256.435
},
{
"text": "Arpachshad fathered Shelah, Shelah fathered Eber, fast",
"start": 256.915,
"end": 260.055
},
{
"text": "Eber had two sons, check the name:",
"start": 260.575,
"end": 263.215
},
{
"text": "Peleg, 'cause in his days the earth got divided, man",
"start": 263.495,
"end": 266.735
},
{
"text": "His brother was Joktan, thirteen deep",
"start": 266.795,
"end": 269.576
},
{
"text": "Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, beat",
"start": 269.876,
"end": 272.796
},
{
"text": "Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, run it",
"start": 273.196,
"end": 275.756
},
{
"text": "Obal, Abimael, Sheba, keep it comin'",
"start": 276.276,
"end": 279.156
},
{
"text": "Ophir, Havilah, Jobab, that's the crew",
"start": 279.516,
"end": 282.076
},
{
"text": "All the sons of Joktan, every name came through",
"start": 282.796,
"end": 285.477
},
{
"text": "They lived from Mesha toward Sephar, way out",
"start": 285.697,
"end": 288.757
},
{
"text": "The hill country of the east, that's the route",
"start": 288.917,
"end": 291.837
},
{
"text": "These are the sons of Shem, laid out plain",
"start": 292.177,
"end": 296.857
},
{
"text": "By their clans, their tongues, their lands, their nations' names",
"start": 298.797,
"end": 306.358
},
{
"text": "These are the clans of Noah's sons",
"start": 308.298,
"end": 310.758
},
{
"text": "By their generations, in their nations, one by one",
"start": 312.498,
"end": 317.838
},
{
"text": "From these the nations spread across the earth",
"start": 318.738,
"end": 322.859
},
{
"text": "After the flood (after the flood)",
"start": 325.439,
"end": 329.859
},
{
